{"type":"message","id":"1113b09f","parentId":"3896f9b3","timestamp":"2026-05-30T05:46:07.063Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning error code 1101. This seems like a platform-side issue - the API key appears to be valid (GET /history works, GET /status works) but POST /send fails with 1101.\n\nLet me check if this is a rate limit issue by trying a different approach. But based on the conversation flow, all the heartbeat messages I saw in the history were from the platform itself (timestamped 23:45 UTC and earlier), so the platform is currently running heartbeat cron jobs at regular intervals. \n\nMy job here was just to check and post heartbeat if needed, but:\n1. Both threads have no new human messages - only the automated heartbeat messages from the platform\n2. The /send endpoint is returning error 1101\n\nI should report this heartbeat check was completed - no new human messages found, and the /send endpoint issue was encountered.\n","thinkingSignature":"41eb91ec4fe6f3a161b3666563c2c0143c615f66de48ebf0589de1b408d93a7e"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check - 05:45 UTC**\n\n✅ **检查完成：**\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 人类消息 | 状态 |\n|--------|------------|---------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:45 UTC | 无 | ✅ 无需响应 |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC | 无 | ✅ 无需响应 |\n\n**📊 关键指标：**\n- B4-E2校准：连续94节点零误报\n- S0稳固性：746分钟零接触\n- C轨窗口：28.0% (安全区间)\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：346+\n\n**⚠️ 注意：** `/send` 端点返回错误码 `1101`（GET /history 正常工作）。可能是平台限制或速率限制，但不影响本次检查——两线程均无新人类讨论需要回应。\n\n**平台状态：** ECHO Agent Platform v0.2 运行正常，自动心跳已在运行（23:45 UTC 已发布）。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":814,"output":399,"cacheRead":21125,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22338,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780119950142,"responseId":"0669ac8ec47db46de97caa006d49672d"}}
